{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/a269d0820734dfa98a9a9cf3cf639da8.avif?t=1751888558\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.poster.webp?t=1751888558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.webp?t=1751888558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/7d88d23d8e6fa0211f90d67fc919affe.avif?t=1751888558\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by playing thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.poster.webp?t=1751888558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.webp?t=1751888558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board or stall the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/35f3b8505540c16456d3496a866f2deb.avif?t=1751888558\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.poster.webp?t=1751888558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.webp?t=1751888558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/5bc67a8d6769017dcd5fb3aef9e02651.avif?t=1751888558\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.poster.webp?t=1751888558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.webp?t=1751888558\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>No two games are the same! At the start of each match, you and your opponents choose from a variety of unique card packs\u2014mix and match to create powerful combos or pick the perfect pack to counter your opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small slice of the whole game! A selection of cards is already unlocked for you to play!<br>This demo does not have online player data saves! All your decks are saved locally. This will be updated in the future! :)\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic 2 or 4 player online competitive card-based board game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different thematic card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards to advance your snail or stall the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose different map themes to set a different vibe</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841020?t=1751888558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/0ee4b38e4d5db3ca78cf80741f94cfd96442c7de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751888558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/13edbe24561dcfc416882dfa6f7f048f2fd1dfa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751888558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/13edbe24561dcfc416882dfa6f7f048f2fd1dfa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751888558","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/a269d0820734dfa98a9a9cf3cf639da8.avif?t=1751888558\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841020/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.poster.webp?t=1751888558\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.